{"seed":97306,"screen":{"seed":97306,"anchorCommit":"14038b1ca8b1","seedClass":"no-herald-attempt","firstCheckDay":null,"firstCheckClass":null,"firstBlockDay":null,"blockedLinks":[],"blocked":false,"checkRows":[],"skippedRows":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"checkCount":0,"heraldAttemptCount":0,"heraldAttempts":[],"waitingSeries":{},"waitingSummary":{},"censusArrears":{"arrearsEver":true,"maxArrearsSeen":8000,"arrearsDays":40,"censusDays":87,"lastCensusDay":90},"transcript":[{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Sal brings it home: Ashford bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":31,"line":"🏃 Felix of Ashford walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Ashford has grain to spare — 2,956 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":38,"line":"⛓️ Fionn brings it home: The Red Table bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":39,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,594 kcal of grain to The Red Table's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🏃 Felix of Ashford walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Ashford has grain to spare — 2,257 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,602 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to The Red Table's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Ashford arrives — 4,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Red Table turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":44,"line":"🧳 The trader lowers their voice. \"And further still — FOUR fires under one head. They call it a REALM. Tribute flows uphill like a river; I saw the grain carts with my own eyes.\" They won't say more. Or can't."},{"day":45,"line":"⛓️ Sal brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":46,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,765 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":46,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"One fire was a village. Two fires is a NETWORK. Coordination layer: online — tribute, demands, the long climb, all tracked now. Try not to starve twice as fast.\""},{"day":48,"line":"Ashford watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":49,"line":"🏃 Felix of Ashford walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Ashford has grain to spare — 2,979 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from The Red Table this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Stonebridge this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":56,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from The Red Table this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":63,"line":"🏃 Felix of Ashford walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Ashford has grain to spare — 2,711 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":63,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Red Table turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":63,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":66,"line":"🍖 FEAST 📺 — Ivy opens the pantry wide: 4× Tribute grain from Ashford, 2× Tribute grain from Ashford, 1× Foraged food. Sal, Yuki, Ruth, Quinn and 3 more eat until the fire burns low. Nobody says what this cost — everybody knows, and winter is listening. For one evening, the pantry is lighter and the people are not. (−3,449 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are wa"},{"day":66,"line":"Ashford watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":66,"line":"The Red Table watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":66,"line":"Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Ashford arrives — 2,250 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Tribute from The Red Table arrives — 3,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Stonebridge arrives — 3,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":76,"line":"🍖 FEAST 📺 — Ruth opens the pantry wide: 8× Foraged food, 8× Muscadine Grapes, 1× Tribute grain from Ashford. Sal, Yuki, Petra, Quinn and 3 more eat until the fire burns low. Nobody says what this cost — everybody knows, and winter is listening. For one evening, the pantry is lighter and the people are not. (−3,247 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (F"},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute from The Red Table arrives — 3,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":83,"line":"🏃 Felix of Ashford walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Ashford has grain to spare — 1,983 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":83,"line":"Ashford watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":83,"line":"The Red Table watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presse